<!-- ════════════════ 49 · COST ALLOCATION & SHOWBACK ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Cost allocation" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #0d9488;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">49</span>FinOps</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Know <span class="accent">who</span> consumes the tokens.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="steps" style="margin-top: 44px; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n" style="color: var(--c);">01</span>
          <h4>Tag every call</h4>
          <p>Put <code>user</code>, team and feature in the metadata of every API call. Shared endpoints make this impossible otherwise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-arrow">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n" style="color: var(--c);">02</span>
          <h4>Showback</h4>
          <p>Make usage visible per team and per feature. Show the costs, without charging them back yet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-arrow">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n" style="color: var(--c);">03</span>
          <h4>Chargeback</h4>
          <p>Charge the costs back to the P&amp;L owner who incurs them. Then saving becomes everyone's interest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        The unit of cost is the token; the unit of accountability is the <strong>user</strong>. Without allocation, savings hang in the air.
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;"><strong>Sources:</strong> FinOps Foundation, Allocation &amp; Invoicing/Chargeback (finops.org): &ldquo;Showback is always required... chargeback is dependent on accounting policies&rdquo; &middot; per-call metadata tags costs to a user.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "49" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "62" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
